  description: 'V5 (visual prefabs): 0:00, no weapons: the specialist and elite variants
    (bomb ketch, needle sloop, net cutter, powder barge, ram raider, repair tender,
    shield frigate, elite hammerhead, elite kraken spawn) and a shark with each elite
    affix look (Armored, Swift, Volatile, Rich, Cursed, Captain): models, health
    bars. Every visual is a prefab under Assets/_Game/V4/Visuals/Prefabs/<Category>/<id>/
    (plan/v5/VISUAL-PREFABS.md): edit one, then load this again from the Tuning Console.'
